                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/releases/tag/14.2.2"&gt;14.2.2: Prevent Popup Race Conditions, (Windows) Folder Picker Initial Path&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; 14.2.2 supersedes 14.2.1, which was not published to NuGet.org due to an expired publishing credential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just a couple bug fixes in this one!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prevent Race Conditions when closing a Popup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set initial folder for FilePicker and FolderPicker on Windows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prevent Race Condition Allowing Simultaneous Calling of &lt;code&gt;Navigation.PushModalAsync()&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;Shell.GotoAsync()&lt;/code&gt; in &lt;code&gt;PopupExtensions&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TheCodeTraveler/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TheCodeTraveler"&gt;@TheCodeTraveler&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4600616393" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3234" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3234/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3234"&gt;#3234&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;SemaphoreSlim&lt;/code&gt; Support for &lt;code&gt;Popup&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;CloseAsync&lt;/code&gt; to Avoid Race Conditions by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TheCodeTraveler/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TheCodeTraveler"&gt;@TheCodeTraveler&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4604729863" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3235" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3235/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3235"&gt;#3235&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
